# tally 2.1.8 R15 (#184), L §5.18, §5.14: a with uncertain total adds the unfulfilled uncertain movements, a sum:
# linear in an uncertain movement's hole amount, plain read or from t.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-06-30

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind maybe: transfers uncertain
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input g: money PLN
input k: money PLN
input gday: date
input kday: date

move gift: maybe
  on gday
  leg cash from world to konto amount g

move fee: maybe
  on kday
  leg cash from konto to world amount k

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  opening[konto] = 100.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  g = ?"how big a gift" "s"
  k = 5.00 PLN "s"
  gday = 2026-02-10 "s"
  kday = 2026-02-11 "s"

ask u1: bal(konto, 2026-03-01) with uncertain partial
ask u2: bal(konto, 2026-03-01) from 2026-01-15 with uncertain partial
=== expect
u1: 95.00 PLN + 1 × ?"how big a gift" (g)
  uncertain: fee
  uncertain: gift
  cut 2026-01-01
u2: 95.00 PLN + 1 × ?"how big a gift" (g)
  uncertain: fee
  uncertain: gift
  cut 2026-01-01
